        text: "| Rejet de la demande (Standard API)   |                                |           | Rejet de la demande (WOOP)   |                   |\n|--------------------------------------|--------------------------------|-----------|------------------------------|-------------------|\n| Id                                   | Code d'erreur                  | Code HTTP | Reasons                      |                   |\n| 1                                    | STORE_NOT_ACTIVE               | 422       | STORE_NOT_ACTIVE             |                   |\n| 2                                    | DELIVERY_OUT_OF_WORKDAYS       | 422       | REFUSED_DAY_OFF              |                   |\n| 3                                    | DELIVERY_SERVICE_NOT_SUPPORTED | 422       | REFUSED_EXCEPTION            |                   |\n| 4                                    | ITEM_MAX_WEiGHT_EXCEEDED       | 422       | REFUSED_TOO_HEAVY            |                   |\n| 5                                    | MAX_VOLUME_EXCEEDED            | 422       | REFUSED_TOO_LARGE            |                   |\n| 6                                    | DELIVERY_TIME_WINDOW_INVALID   | 422       | REFUSED_TIME_NOT_WORKED      |                   |\n| 7                                    | CUTOFF_EXCEEDED                | 422       | REFUSED_TOO_LATE             |                   |\n| 8                                    | NOT_PRICED                     |           | 422                          | REFUSED_EXCEPTION |\n**Demande d’annulation d’une commande**",
